{"server":"tw","storyId":"act26side_level_act26side_05_end","groupId":"act26side","stageId":"act26side_05","title":"主在聖殿中","storyCode":"HE-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act26side/level_act26side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"d0205252c8b1a83f762a622fb14d1559969b74c27a1988a6ede1cda8bc270681","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i13"},{"type":"narration","text":"“主啊，請您原諒......”\n“我曾發過誓言，要善待所有求助者，無論是誰，需一視同仁，盡我所能地提供幫助。”\n“但我食言了。”\n“我已無法回應渴求救助之人，我無法讓他們留下，只因我們的物資不足，無法負擔。”\n“在一群人與另一群人之間，我必須做出選擇......”\n“......選擇。是的，我早已做過不止一次選擇......”\n“可選擇是錯誤的。而今，我已無法忍受更多錯誤。”\n“我已不能再背棄我的信仰，為救人而捨棄，為多數而拋下少數！”\n“拉特蘭......我久未重逢的故鄉......”\n“為何僅有拉特蘭才是樂園？”\n“若通向我所信的前提，乃是背棄我腦中高懸的指引；若只有借助異教，才可真正消除障礙......”\n“......再過不久，一切都將得出答案。”\n“倘若我們的主真的存在，就請您寬恕我的罪過......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“——！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g12_anbandonspace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別動手，別動手，有話好好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找了您好一會呢，主教閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近食物缺得厲害，只有這點東西能招待客人，你不介意吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"介意也沒別的了，味道可能不太好，不過只求填飽肚子的話勉強還可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有進食的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃吧。都拿出來了，別浪費。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲領袖杰拉爾德，你認識那兩名黎博利孩童。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你總是這麼直接嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喊我領袖，我見過真正的薩卡茲的王，我一介獵戶配不上這稱呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼自稱獵戶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我確實是個獵戶。我靠打獵養活自己和其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然是今天剛到，但我猜你應該已經瞭解這裡的情況了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不完全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶著薩卡茲在這裡生活，你們是後來者，但曾經融入得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，曾經是不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你們與其他人產生衝突，根據目前的局勢判斷，這種衝突很大可能會繼續升級。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的判斷沒錯。所以我們就要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正常情況下，在與其他居民的衝突中，你們會佔據上風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的原住民中少見擅長戰鬥的人員，他們缺乏戰鬥力也是你們被接受的原因之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如今拉特蘭的介入讓你們失去了在武力上的優勢。離開是穩妥的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很擅長得出合理的解釋，執行者閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但從很久之前我就明白，到現在也仍在時刻被提醒——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的生活從不合理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"燭光跳動。\n年長的薩卡茲的視線落在牆壁上，那裡映出模糊的虛影，一切差異在此時都不再清晰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不會因無法生存而選擇離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在來到這裡之前，老實說，我從未想過能夠有這樣的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有種種風險，有許多摩擦，但我們被認可、被接納，我們親手搭建住所，靠勞動獲得糧食......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這在你看來很尋常，但對我們來說，這是曾經不敢想像的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們選擇離開的真正理由是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就如你所說，我們都能預見將會有的衝突，隔閡已經存在，無人能夠修補，我只能眼睜睜地看著一切越來越糟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還只是爭吵，只是責怪。可接下來呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......爭吵升級為暴力衝突，普通居民與薩卡茲互相怨恨的可能性很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚的火災或許是一個警示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在離開，我們仍是值得懷念的夥伴，是令人惋惜的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而要是放任那些不捨情緒，再不做出決定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將會重新成為世人眼中的薩卡茲——只會挑起爭端，在哪裡都不受歡迎，沒有歸處亦沒有去處的一群流浪之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這只是偏見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們來說卻是事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔有你們的拉特蘭城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而薩卡茲......我們何曾真正屬於過什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想是時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生得晚的那些年輕人可能會不太習慣晚上沒有屋簷的生活，不過他們會適應的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於今天的那兩個孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我確實知道點他們的來歷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"修道院內的居民與萊蒙德並不知情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道他們存在的人很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是猜測，他們應該是外來的流浪者，或許是家人遭難，或許是被拋棄，都有可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從前斯特凡諾不是沒有接納過類似的流浪者，只是以現在的狀況來看，這裡很難再負擔更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......有人偷偷收養了這兩個孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很少有什麼事真的能一直完美地隱瞞下去，特別是在現在這種每一粒稻穀都要被計較的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼收養了他們。每天從自己那份口糧裡省一部分，還有幾回偷偷動了狩獵的獵物，我發覺之後都替她補上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，他們的日子仍然過得比較艱難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位赫曼女士現在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我也正在想她去哪了。今天她本該帶著狩獵的獵物回來，但到現在也沒有消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還沒找到她。她失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不論如何，我由衷地希望她不會做什麼傻事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失蹤？不，不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼女士秘密收養兩個孩童，平時不會允許他們獨自外出，艾倫戴爾和艾絲塔拉出現在聖堂不是意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......有人帶著他們出門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫曼女士的家在哪？我需要親自去查看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"破舊的木屋對幼小的孩子們來說是一處港灣。\n因成年人無力養育而像是不被需要的廢棄品一般遭到拋棄，又在流浪於荒野、奄奄一息時，被毫無關係的薩卡茲拾起。\n被偷偷領到這間破破爛爛的小屋，這裡有漏風的木板和不保暖的被褥，有破舊但整潔的衣裳，還有不美味但足以果腹的食物。\n儘管它無法完全抵禦寒風，就算將家中所有能夠禦寒的布料堆在一起，再把冬衣緊緊裹在身上，蝕骨的寒意仍讓人在睡夢中也不禁蜷縮。\n但這是“家”。家裡還有媽媽。\n這裡就是孩子們最能夠安心的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i05_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"細小的呼吸聲並未被不速之客驚擾。\n它們依舊平穩、綿長。\n猙獰扭曲的陰影投灑在孩子們身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（古怪的輕語）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......餓、吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（翻身）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃、吃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冷......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"失去曾經形態的怪物發出低沉古怪的吟語。\n那片始終停留的影子終於有了動作。\n在月光下，怪物粗長有力的尾部探向前方，帶著潮濕氣息的尖端掃過孩子稚嫩的面頰，隨即——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i05_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"它落在了柔軟無力的，小小的“監牢”裡。\n艾絲塔拉和艾倫戴爾仍在睡夢之中。只是身體下意識地，靠向那股讓人感到安心的氣息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"扭曲的怪物","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾倫戴爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾絲塔拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......餓......吃、吃......冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蓋上......蓋上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冷......蓋上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾......倫......薩拉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g12_anbandonspace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教閣下做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只不過是在此告解，來自拉特蘭的執行者，你應該知道此時不能偷聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，別誤會，我當然沒有聽到閣下告解的內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦，閣下應該也知道，我問的不是這個，也不是想知道閣下之前派了什麼人去敲鐘，怎麼安排修道院眾人的飲食......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問的是從頂層聖堂傳來的氣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你分辨得出那種助燃物的味道？......格芬區的銃械工廠，如今還在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，據我所知，它們依然為各大學院供給練習用的銃械。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，燃燒彈也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唯有聖城存續千年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到閣下很難過。唉，應該得怪費德里科那小子，辦事總是這麼直接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過目前只是建築的一角燒毀了而已，一切都還留有餘地，大家還是可以安穩地回到拉特蘭，閣下覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你恐怕找錯人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拆用修道院內舊軍火的方法，我早就教給了所有人。燃料有限，冬天很長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你若是認為，我是那場火災的教唆者......我無意反駁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，我們還是找個地方坐下來，再好好聊一聊，怎麼樣？談出一個雙方都能接受的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——聊一聊？方案？呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有哪一種方案不用在人與人之間做選擇？我已經陳述過我的信念，你們難道當真能讓步？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前，這一地區遭遇大旱，一隊難民流浪到停泊在荒野中的修道院，請求我們收留，但我對他們關上了大門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們跌跌撞撞，幾乎是爬進荒野深處。那不是我第一次注視那樣的場景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我向主起誓，那會是最後一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執行者，我的信念難道有錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，您當然是正確的，我理解您的悲痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不得不承認，拉特蘭有它力不能及的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，律法有它不完善的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會思考，自然就會質疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過......就算有不完美的地方，現在的拉特蘭對我來說卻也已經足夠好了，我不希望有任何人或事，威脅到這種平靜與和諧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教閣下，我想您應該能夠理解這種感覺吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我們現在達成協議，閣下不做節外生枝的事情，那我說服某些同事也會比較容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們誰都不動手，這趟外勤任務就可以完成得輕鬆一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里凱萊","speakerId":"avg_npc_372_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不能保證所有人都回到拉特蘭，我覺得，也沒必要搞得所有人都回不去拉特蘭嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的使者，拉特蘭之於你，正如此處之於我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想你我之間已無再談下去的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修道院主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_923_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——請回吧，不要再打擾我告解了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g1_monasteryentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊蒙德？這麼晚了，怎麼還不回去休息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你啊，克萊芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我還有點事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天的事，實在很對不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意了，反正我們也要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們打算什麼時候出發......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看杰拉爾德老大的意思，明早不論如何都會動身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是在明早參加完晨會之後吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晨會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，克萊芒！你......知不知道福爾圖娜和德爾菲娜在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來打算喊她們，呃，沒什麼，總之我找她們有點事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等，萊蒙德，杰拉爾德難道沒有把那件事告訴你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？你說什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克萊芒","speakerId":"avg_npc_924_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德爾菲娜已經......她已經不在了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再......見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"假設我的聽覺沒有出問題——這是否是一句告別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擁有一定程度的語言能力，看來之前的判斷有誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科、塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保有思考能力，或者說，初步可判斷為現階段殘留一定的邏輯思考與自主決斷能力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軀體異化，但可以交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不確定是否具有感染性，無法確定行為模式是否會隨時間變化，危險程度未知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根據公證所相關條例，為保障公民權益，准許現場擊殺難以判定級別的威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有反抗表現，疑似沒有求生欲望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失禮了，我會盡可能減輕痛感。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物佇立在原地。\n眼前是被阻塞的前路，身後是無法回頭的曾經。\n一切辯白與嘶吼、苦痛與不甘都在穿透堅硬表皮展露在外之前，被消化在這具已脫離人類範疇的軀體之內。\n異化的怪物在無法逾越的阻力面前，失去所有力氣，卻又堅持不肯放下最後一點尊嚴。\n它只是沉默著，靜立著。\n宛如一尊雕像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動手！執行者閣下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“扭曲的怪物”","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......杰拉......爾德......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫曼。你知道嗎，我差點都想學著斯特凡諾他們祈禱了——祈禱執行者閣下說的“怪物”不會是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最合乎邏輯的推論。現在也已經得到證實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開，杰拉爾德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能讓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恕我直言，這是妨礙公務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很清楚。你隨時可以朝我扣下扳機，除掉我這個有罪的薩卡茲，我絕不會有怨言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不能讓你對赫曼動手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給不了你一個“正當”或是“合理”的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能說的只有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看赫曼身後。在那層門板後面，現在正睡著兩個孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_930_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的、孩子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們對發生了什麼一無所知，期待你能夠找到他們的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們信任你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個薩卡茲，用他飽經風霜的、粗糙的手，按住了一個薩科塔握著銃的手。\n不帶兄弟間的親近與依賴，沒有夥伴間的信任與理解。\n但薩卡茲確實按住了薩科塔的手。\n銃口一寸寸垂下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動手。執行者閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰拉爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_926_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你能得出結論，說服你自己之前，別動手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
